WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.334
The robot arm grasps a dark bowl from the stove, lifts it, and moves it to the left to place it onto a white plate on the table.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Grasp the dark bowl on the stove and lift it upward

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Move the bowl to the left and lower it onto the white plate

4
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Release the bowl and retract the arm
